This repo is a Dexwin live AI/LLM interview assessment.

The Northline ops RAG app is an intentionally broken/naive baseline. Candidates are expected to diagnose and improve retrieval, prompts, grounding, citations, and refusals.

Do not silently rewrite the pipeline into a production RAG stack. Explain tradeoffs. Do not commit `.env` or API keys. Prefer fixture mode (`USE_FIXTURES=true`) unless a capped org key is set.
